WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:03.024
Setelah kemarin PC berhasil dirakit sesuai kebutuhanmu

00:00:03.326 --> 00:00:06.221
percuma kalau spesifikasinya tinggi tapi sistemnya dipasang

00:00:06.221 --> 00:00:07.063
asal-asalan

00:00:07.961 --> 00:00:10.605
OS bajakan rawan malware dan kebocoran data

00:00:10.895 --> 00:00:13.460
sedangkan driver seadanya bikin performa tertahan dan

00:00:13.461 --> 00:00:14.513
gampang blue screen